        ],
        "description": "Monochrome 的目的是消除 32 位 Chrome 和 Webview 库之间的重复（大部分库是相同的）。在 32 位 Monochrome 中，单个组合库同时满足 Chrome 和 Webview 的需求。64 位版本增加了一个仅限 Webview 的库。",
        "source_link": "https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src.git/+/HEAD/docs/android_native_libraries.md"
      }
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "data": {
        "label": "libmonochrome",
        "dev_team": "Chromium",
        "rule_contributors": [
          "lifansama"
        ],
        "description": "Monochrome's intent was to eliminate the duplication between the 32-bit Chrome and Webview libraries (most of the library is identical). In 32-bit Monochrome, a single combined library serves both Chrome and Webview needs. The 64-bit version adds an extra Webview-only library.",
        "source_link": "https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src.git/+/HEAD/docs/android_native_libraries.md"
      }
    }
